cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  LabMiM Micrometeorology and Solar Radiation Intelligence
abstract: >-
  Toolkit for solar irradiance and micrometeorology research at the LabMiM
  station, Universidade Federal da Bahia, Salvador, Brazil. It post-processes
  WRF output for web mapping, builds a quality-controlled archive from the
  station's Campbell dataloggers, estimates diffuse horizontal irradiance from
  all-sky camera images with multimodal deep learning, and corrects the model's
  diffuse radiation bias with machine learning.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mascarenhas
    given-names: Bruno
    affiliation: >-
      Laboratório de Micrometeorologia (LabMiM), Universidade Federal da Bahia
repository-code: https://github.com/Bruno-Mascarenhas/micrometeorology
license: MIT
keywords:
  - solar radiation
  - solar irradiance
  - micrometeorology
  - all-sky imager
  - WRF
  - deep learning
